How about an option to require me to type a shifted "Y" and "N" when
answering questions, or at least wait until a carriage-return so I can
undo my stupid mistake?  Also, I would really like the option to turn
off automatic removal of the last pieces of armor/rings/amulets/etc (in
otherwords, to always ask me what I want to remove, even if I am only
wearing one thing, so I can have the opportunity to cancel.) This usually
doesn't kill me, but I'm always removing rings that I'm not wearing, and
having to put my amulet of lifesaving back on - a minor inconvenience.

